Thanks, those do indeed look the same, so presumably something is
happening on the way to the sp::over() call. The creation of the
integration points seems like a prime candidate>
Can you please provide the following:

ips <- fm_int(domain = list(coordinates = spatial_list$mesh, distance
= INLA::inla.mesh.1d(seq(0, W, length.out = 30)),
  samplers = spatial_list$transects)

head(ips)
head(spatial_list$transects)

proj4string(ips)
proj4string(spatial_list$transects)

fm_CRS(ips)
fm_CRS(spatial_list$transects)

Finn

